---
import ServicePage from '../../components/services/ServicePage.astro';

export const prerender = true;

const canonical = 'https://busqueneil.com/hire/ai-engineer-nyc';

const FAQ = [
  {
    q: 'Can you meet in person in New York City?',
    a: "Yes, when it helps. I'm a short trip from Manhattan, so I can join a kickoff or a working session in Manhattan or Brooklyn. The day-to-day build happens remotely.",
  },
  {
    q: 'Who does the work?',
    a: "I do. You talk to the person building it, from the first message to launch and after. There's no account manager in between.",
  },
  {
    q: 'Can we start small?',
    a: 'Yes. Start with one build. If it pays off, we plan the next one or move to a monthly arrangement.',
  },
];
---
<ServicePage
  title="AI Engineer for NYC Teams | Neil Busque"
  description="Neil Busque builds AI agents, automations and web apps for NYC teams, with in-person work available when useful and remote delivery for the build."
  canonical={canonical}
  active="hire"
  heading="Hire an **AI engineer for NYC**."
  lead="I'm Neil Busque, an AI engineer based just outside New York City. I build agents, LLM features, automations and apps for NYC teams, in person when it helps and remote for the rest."
  crumbs={[
    { name: 'Home', url: 'https://busqueneil.com/' },
    { name: 'Hire', url: 'https://busqueneil.com/hire' },
    { name: 'AI Engineer in NYC', url: canonical },
  ]}
  backLabel="When to hire me"
  topic="hiring an AI engineer for NYC"
  artSeed="hire-ai-engineer-nyc"
  artPalette="paper"
  summary={{
    items: [
      'Inbound agents that answer and qualify leads',
      'LLM features inside your product or tools',
      'Automations that replace a manual process',
      'Internal tools, with a first version in days',
      'In-person kickoffs in Manhattan or Brooklyn',
    ],
    facts: [
      { term: 'Good for', value: 'Startups, agencies and service teams in New York City' },
      { term: 'How it starts', value: 'A message, then a call or an in-person kickoff' },
      { term: 'What you own', value: 'The code, the prompts and every account' },
    ],
  }}
  related={['ai-ads-app', 'meeting-notes-to-tasks']}
  relatedPalettes={['mist', 'navy']}
  faq={FAQ}
  service={{
    name: 'AI Engineer for NYC',
    serviceType: ['AI engineering', 'AI agent development', 'LLM application development', 'AI automation'],
    areaServed: [
      { '@type': 'City', name: 'New York City' },
      { '@type': 'City', name: 'Manhattan' },
      { '@type': 'City', name: 'Brooklyn' },
    ],
  }}
>
  <h2>Close enough to be in the room</h2>
  <p>Some decisions are easier with everyone at the same table. I'm a short trip from Manhattan, so I can join an in-person kickoff or a working session in Manhattan or Brooklyn, then run the rest of the build remotely.</p>

  <h2>The work I can take on</h2>
  <p>I can plug into a startup, agency, media company or professional-services team for a focused build: an inbound agent, an LLM feature, an automation that replaces a manual process or a full internal tool. Read <a href="/guides/build-ai-agent-claude-code">how I build agents</a> and <a href="/guides/ship-web-app-in-days-with-ai">how I ship apps in days</a>.</p>

  <h2>Work you can check</h2>
  <p>I shipped more than 40 apps, agents and automations in 2026. Client names stay private, so each build is named for what it does. See <a href="/work">the projects</a> and read <a href="/resources">the guides</a> before we talk.</p>

  <h2>Let's talk</h2>
  <p>Message me on WhatsApp, email <a href="mailto:busqueneil@gmail.com">busqueneil@gmail.com</a> or find me on <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/neilbusque/" rel="me noopener" target="_blank">LinkedIn</a>. Based in New Jersey instead? See <a href="/hire/ai-engineer-nj">an AI engineer in New Jersey</a>, or go fully <a href="/hire/ai-engineer-remote">remote</a>. More on <a href="/hire">when to bring me in</a>.</p>
</ServicePage>
